(6398833, 947561, 123094, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! When casting votes I wanted to stay away from thinking "oh, that would be a good album cover for that song/lyric," but instead look at the meaning of the song/lyric and compare the feeling of that with the mood of the photo...you nailed it.</td>', 'Brilliant! When casting votes I wanted to stay away from thinking "oh, that would be a good album cover for that song/lyric," but instead look at the meaning of the song/lyric and compare the feeling of that with the mood of the photo...you nailed it.', '2011-04-29 16:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6398842, 947783, 123094, '<td valign="top">After laughing hysterically from the "flashbacks" of the Flash Gordon movie (which this song is arguably the best part of the film) I just had to rate this as one of the highest in the group. Before I even saw the title I knew what you were going for lyric-wise.</td>', 'After laughing hysterically from the "flashbacks" of the Flash Gordon movie (which this song is arguably the best part of the film) I just had to rate this as one of the highest in the group. Before I even saw the title I knew what you were going for lyric-wise.', '2011-04-29 16:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
