(6404652, 947561, 98339, '<td valign="top">good job!!!  I personally would love to know more about the photo...where was it taken and how did you set it up..."if" you did...my top pick for sure</td>', 'good job!!!  I personally would love to know more about the photo...where was it taken and how did you set it up..."if" you did...my top pick for sure', '2011-05-04 23:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6404665, 947561, 88409, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> good job!!!  I personally would love to know more about the photo...where was it taken and how did you set it up..."if" you did...my top pick for sure </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>not much to say really,  Photo was taken at "the location"...after climbing some fences, and crawling in some stuff I would not like to see again (with camera gear, mic/stand, and three roses in tow) I was there. Little clean up (maid did not show for work in a while) and I was ready to take a couple snapshots and get out of there...<br/> <br/>The lyrics for the song were the main reason for the more somber tone/mood (darkness) of the photograph. Post processing I had 2 versions, one being brighter than the other, but felt the point was more direct in the darker tone.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: good job!!!  I personally would love to know more about the photo...where was it taken and how did you set it up..."if" you did...my top pick for sure   not much to say really,  Photo was taken at "the location"...after climbing some fences, and crawling in some stuff I would not like to see again (with camera gear, mic/stand, and three roses in tow) I was there. Little clean up (maid did not show for work in a while) and I was ready to take a couple snapshots and get out of there... The lyrics for the song were the main reason for the more somber tone/mood (darkness) of the photograph. Post processing I had 2 versions, one being brighter than the other, but felt the point was more direct in the darker tone.', '2011-05-04 23:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
